{"lang":"es","dir":"ltr","title":"Romack Home Maintenance Services (Rowmack Inc.) | Handyman en Vacaville, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Ir al contenido</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">R</span><span>Romack Home Maintenance Services</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Nosotros</a><a href=\"#services\">Servicios</a><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntas</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Fotos</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Reseñas</a><a href=\"#visit\">Horario y ubicación</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Idioma\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\" selected>Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">Llamar</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/cedar-steps.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Handyman · Vacaville, CA · Rowmack Inc.</p>\n    <h1>Romack Home Maintenance Services</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">El handyman que sí puede. Bob Mackert aporta más de 25 años de experiencia en reparaciones, instalaciones y carpintería en tu casa, un proyecto a la vez.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · 39 reseñas en Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama o escribe a Bob</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Romack%20Home%20Maintenance%20Services%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Mapa</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.9★ de 39 reseñas</a></li><li>Más de 25 años de experiencia</li><li>Muchas veces respondo el mismo día</li><li>Limpio después de cada trabajo</li><li>Acepto tarjetas de crédito</li><li>Abierto los sábados</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Conoce a Bob</p><h2>Un proyecto a la vez.</h2><p>Romack Home Maintenance Services, también conocido como Rowmack Inc., soy yo, Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert, handyman en Vacaville. Tengo más de 25 años de experiencia, y si tu proyecto tiene que ver con madera o con casas, mi lista de habilidades es larga, desde lo sencillo hasta lo hecho a la medida.</p><p>Respondo rápido, muchas veces el mismo día, llego a tiempo, cobro precios justos y dejo todo limpio. Muchos clientes me vuelven a llamar para un proyecto tras otro en su casa.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>39 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>25+ años</b><span>De experiencia</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>Lun–sáb</b><span>Abierto 6 días</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"Escalones de madera en la entrada con barandal\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Servicios</p><h2>Lo que hace Bob</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Sheetrock y texturizado</h3></div><p>Reparación de sheetrock y texturizado de techos.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación y reparación de puertas</h3></div><p>Puertas interiores, exteriores y laterales de cochera: instalación, ajuste y reparación.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación y reparación de pisos</h3></div><p>Pisos laminados y zoclos.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Armado de muebles</h3></div><p>Escritorios y más, armados rápido.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Carpintería</h3></div><p>Proyectos de madera, desde lo sencillo hasta lo hecho a la medida.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Retiro y reemplazo de madera podrida</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Sellado con calafateo</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Reparaciones de plomería</h3></div><p>Cambio de regaderas y otras piezas.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación de accesorios y electrodomésticos</h3></div><p>Ventiladores de techo y microondas sobre la estufa, y me llevo los aparatos viejos.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">No publico precios en línea, pero mis precios son justos y razonables. Llama o manda mensaje al (707) 317-8126 para platicar sobre tu proyecto.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Bueno saber</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Acepto tarjetas de crédito</b></li><li><b>Respuesta rápida</b><span>Muchas veces el mismo día, a veces en menos de una hora</span></li><li><b>Limpio el área de trabajo</b><span>Limpio después de cada trabajo</span></li><li><b>Me llevo los aparatos viejos</b></li><li><b>Abierto los sábados</b><span>9 AM–3 PM</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Proyectos recientes</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tile-shower.jpg\" alt=\"Pared de regadera con azulejo\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fireplace-wall.jpg\" alt=\"Pared de chimenea de piedra\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/deck-rebuild.jpg\" alt=\"Terraza de madera en construcción\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/treehouse-deck.jpg\" alt=\"Terraza de madera elevada\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shed.jpg\" alt=\"Cobertizo de almacenamiento\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/garden-bench.jpg\" alt=\"Banca de madera para jardín\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/laminate-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Piso tipo madera en un pasillo\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"Escalones de madera en la entrada\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">El dueño</p><h2>En palabras de Bob</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Handyman services, With the one project at a time attitude. laminate floor installation, Doors installed, With over 25 yrs experience, If your project involves wood and/or houses, My list of skills goes on, From simple to custom, You get what you want with Rowmack .inc Simply put, The handyman that can.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Robert Mackert, owner</b> · In Bob&#39;s words</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 39 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 12 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/rowmack-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“He is the best handyman I’ve ever hired. Very professional and kind. We are very satisfied.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I am absolutely thrilled to write a review for Robert, who recently installed a ceiling fan in my home. From start to finish, the experience was nothing short of exceptional. Robert is the epitome of professionalism. He arrived precisely on time, which I greatly appreciate, and immediately got to work. Beyond his punctuality, his demeanor was incredibly pleasant, and he even had a great sense of humor that made the whole process enjoyable. What truly set Robert apart was his keen eye and observant nature. He noticed a small detail about the wiring that could have caused an issue down the line…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My husband text Bob, today Sunday March 2, 2025 to replace a shower head in one of our bathrooms. Bob, responded immediately and said that he’d be out today, he arrived within the hour and replaced the shower head within a few minutes. He’s quick, reasonably priced and more importantly, he cleans up behind himself. We use Bob on a regular basis for various repairs around the house.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is very helpful, very affordable and upfront. I called and he showed up within an hour and a half. I had one project that I called him out for, but after having him look at the main project, I intend on using his services for all of my other projects that need to be taken care of.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I called ROWMACK today and spoke with Robert Mackert. I will be working from home starting tomorrow and my desk was still in the box!!! Bob came to my house and within an hour my desk was complete. He is also very nice. So if you need someone to put your furniture together, please call my new handy man at ROWMACK INC! Trust me, you will be glad you did!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Robert responded the same day. He arrived on time and went to work. Completed task in a reasonable time and charged a fair fee for a difficult job. Cleaned up his work area. I am very pleased and would not hesitate to hire him again.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Sep 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is an excellent worker. Shows up when he says he will and makes sure whatever he is working on is repaired correctly. We’ve had three different people work on our door, but they never fixed it. Bob put in the time to make sure it was done correctly. He is reasonable in his pricing and very kind. We will definitely be using his services in the future!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob of Rowmack Inc Handyman Services did a side garage door install. He knew exactly what was required to start and finish the project in a timely matter. His professional talent produced outstanding results. I am more than pleased with his work. I have already ask Bob to schedule me in for another install in the kitchen. Highly Recommended”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Such great service received today. I found Bob&#39;s information while searching for someone to install my over the range microwave. I reached out to Bob and he was very responsive and was able to get me all set up this morning. Bob even recommended an earlier time. I really can say what quality work and Bob hauled away the old appliance as well. I will recommend Bob to anyone and even make use of him again for other things needed to be done in my house. If I could have given 10 stars I would.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2021</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob knows his stuff! He did an awesome job installing our lament flooring and baseboards, he also was so fast at texturing my ceilings, and did some great electrical work for us. I love how flexible he is with our schedule and overall really fun to work with, I would highly recommend for any construction job!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Apr 2018</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Romack es lo mismo que Rowmack Inc.?</summary><p>Sí, soy yo. Me llamo Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert, y mi negocio se conoce como Romack Home Maintenance Services y también como Rowmack Inc.</p></details><details><summary>¿Qué tipo de trabajos haces?</summary><p>Reparación y texturizado de sheetrock, puertas, pisos laminados y zoclos, armado de muebles, carpintería, reparación de madera podrida, calafateo, cambio de piezas de plomería, ventiladores de techo e instalación de electrodomésticos. Si tiene que ver con madera o con casas, pregúntame.</p></details><details><summary>¿Qué tan rápido puedes venir?</summary><p>Muchas veces, rápido. Con frecuencia respondo el mismo día, a veces en una hora o una hora y media.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánto cuesta?</summary><p>No publico precios en línea, pero mis precios son justos, accesibles y claros desde el principio. Llámame o mándame mensaje al (707) 317-8126 para contarme de tu proyecto.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es tu horario?</summary><p>Trabajo de lunes a viernes de 7 AM a 6 PM y el sábado de 9 AM a 3 PM. Cerrado el domingo.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptas tarjetas de crédito?</summary><p>Sí, acepto tarjetas de crédito.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánta experiencia tienes?</summary><p>Tengo más de 25 años de experiencia.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Zona de servicio</p>\n      <h2>Horario y zona de servicio</h2>\n      <address>Damos servicio en Vacaville, CA<br>Con sede en Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">(707) 317-8126</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Llama o manda mensaje para agendar una visita.</p>\n     